        "original_id": "217fce83-ed18-50fa-ba68-f9a77fd84340",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Tony Kaye\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, documentary director, music video director, advertisement director\n- Awards: Academy Award, Best Director, Best Writing, Screenplay\n- Works: A Letter to Three Wives, All About Eve\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph L. Mankiewicz was born on February 11, 1909, and he was an American film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Joseph L. Mankiewicz won the Academy Award for Best Director and Best Writing, Screenplay for A Letter to Three Wives in 1949.\n- Joseph L. Mankiewicz won the Academy Award for Best Director and Best Writing, Screenplay for All About Eve in 1950.\n- Tony Kaye was born on 8 July 1952, and he is a British director of films, music videos, advertisements, and documentaries.\n- Joseph L. Mankiewicz died on February 5, 1993.",
